From: Ubuntu Desktop bug work
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: update/hooks: tolerate empty stderr and malformed hook files

g_spawn_sync can leave stderr NULL; strlen(ret) crashed on the
live-CD path. Folded RFC822 lines before any header, missing
Description/Name, and a failed /proc/uptime read also crashed.

Forwarded: no
